SYSTEM notes
REPORTS message
RUNS publish

PLACE text ONE OUTSIDE
PLACE draft ONE LASTING
PLACE site ONE LASTING
PLACE message ONE REPORT

FACT preview
    SAYS --preview is given
FAULT the note is empty ABOUT text
FAULT the site is down
    SAYS the site does not answer

SEQ publish
    ACTION save draft
        READS text
        CREATE draft
            LATER UNDONE
        REFUSE WHEN the note is empty
    ACTION put on site
        READS draft
        CREATE site
        REFUSE WHEN the site is down

RULE a preview shows the note as it will appear
    ABOUT put on site
    WHEN preview
